          "percentage discount per booking",
          "average discount given per booking"
        ],
        "table": "bookings",
        "definition": "The realized percentage discount given on a booking transaction is calculated directly from booking transaction columns: ROUND(AVG(discount / actual_amount * 100), 2) FROM bookings WHERE actual_amount > 0 AND status = 1. Do not join to the offer table or use offer catalog prices when measuring discount per booking.",
